        "content": "<a class=\"article-button\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://rest.com.au/rest_web/media/documents/employer/payday-super-checklist.pdf?utm_medium=newsletter&utm_source=ara&utm_campaign=employer_leads_2026&utm_content=payday_super&up_id=01fca00\">GET THE GUIDE</a>"
      }
    ]
